        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='8506' id='6' story-point-id='1' type-v2='text' w='57776' x='2657' y='76763'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='9'>- Dual-product users churn the least (50.6%)</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='9'>, showing they gain the most value from Uber One.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='9'>- Eats-only and Rides-only users churn more (65.8% / 59.1%)</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='9'>   ,suggesting single-product value isn’t enough to justify renewal.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='9'>Multi-product engagement</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='9'> is the </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='9'>strongest</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='9'> driver of retention and a key segment for targeted strategies.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
